01:49:01.762 --> 01:49:03.762


981
01:49:03.762 --> 01:49:06.762
For Christ died for us,

982
01:49:06.762 --> 01:49:09.762
and took our punishment upon Himself.

983
01:49:09.762 --> 01:49:11.762
And what is even better,

984
01:49:11.762 --> 01:49:13.762
he has risen from the dead.

985
01:49:13.762 --> 01:49:15.762
Now he sits next to God,

986
01:49:15.762 --> 01:49:17.762
and intercedes for us.

987
01:49:17.762 --> 01:49:20.762
Who or what can separate us then,

988
01:49:20.762 --> 01:49:22.762
from the love of Christ?

989
01:49:22.762 --> 01:49:25.762
Difficulties, problems, persecution,

990
01:49:25.762 --> 01:49:29.762
lack of food, lack of clothing, danger or death?

991
01:49:29.762 --> 01:49:32.762
It is as it is written in the books,

992
01:49:32.762 --> 01:49:36.762
because we believe in Jesus, we are in danger of death all day long.

993
01:49:36.762 --> 01:49:39.762
People treat us like sheep to be slaughtered.

994
01:49:39.762 --> 01:49:44.762
But in all difficulties, we are more than conquerors,

995
01:49:44.762 --> 01:49:46.762
thanks to him who loves us.

996
01:49:46.762 --> 01:49:49.762
For I know that no death...

997
01:49:49.762 --> 01:49:50.762
Was that also wrong?

998
01:49:50.762 --> 01:49:53.762
Yes, no angels or demonic spirits,

999
01:49:53.762 --> 01:49:57.762
no power, no things present or in the future,

1000
01:49:57.762 --> 01:50:01.762
no power from above or from below,

1001
01:50:01.762 --> 01:50:06.762
no, nothing on this earth can separate us from the love of God.

1002
01:50:06.762 --> 01:50:09.762
That love has been given to us by God,

1003
01:50:09.762 --> 01:50:11.762
through Jesus Christ our Lord.

1004
01:50:11.762 --> 01:50:13.762
Give him a round of applause.

1005
01:50:14.762 --> 01:50:16.762
Praise God.

1006
01:50:22.762 --> 01:50:24.762
Praise God.

1007
01:50:24.762 --> 01:50:26.762
Can we close our eyes?

1008
01:50:26.762 --> 01:50:28.762
Hallelujah, praise God.

1009
01:50:28.762 --> 01:50:33.762
Lord, I really want through your Holy Spirit,

1010
01:50:33.762 --> 01:50:37.762
that you inspire us in our hearts,

1011
01:50:37.762 --> 01:50:43.762
that we truly come to understand and see the gospel of Jesus.

1012
01:50:43.762 --> 01:50:47.762
Not as a loud sermon, but as God's Word,

1013
01:50:47.762 --> 01:50:49.762
which will take root in our hearts.

1014
01:50:49.762 --> 01:50:56.762
That we will understand that we should have been overcome in our sin.

1015
01:50:56.762 --> 01:50:59.762
But through Jesus Christ we have been redeemed.

1016
01:50:59.762 --> 01:51:03.762
And Jesus triumphed over my sin on the cross

1017
01:51:03.762 --> 01:51:05.762
and openly put it to shame,

1018
01:51:05.762 --> 01:51:10.762
so that I do not have to live in shame, but may live in the freedom of Christ.

1019
01:51:10.762 --> 01:51:13.762
And I want to pray for everyone, while all eyes are closed,

1020
01:51:13.762 --> 01:51:15.762
I want to pray for everyone.

1021
01:51:15.762 --> 01:51:18.762
If there is still a demon, if there is still an uncleanness,

1022
01:51:18.762 --> 01:51:22.762
if there is still a stubbornness, if there is still a hostility,

1023
01:51:22.762 --> 01:51:25.762
that you have not dealt with,

1024
01:51:25.762 --> 01:51:27.762
through the blood of Jesus Christ,

1025
01:51:27.762 --> 01:51:30.762
just like at the beginning of this service when we sang,

1026
01:51:30.762 --> 01:51:32.762
You are worthy of it all.

1027
01:51:32.762 --> 01:51:35.762
I want to encourage you in the name of Jesus, through the Holy Spirit.

1028
01:51:35.762 --> 01:51:37.762
Give it to Jesus.

1029
01:51:37.762 --> 01:51:39.762
Bring it to the cross.

1030
01:51:39.762 --> 01:51:41.762
This week, in your personal prayers,

1031
01:51:41.762 --> 01:51:44.762
when you are in your car, when you go to bed,

1032
01:51:44.762 --> 01:51:45.762
when you take a walk in the woods.

1033
01:51:45.762 --> 01:51:47.762
Give it to Jesus.

1034
01:51:47.762 --> 01:51:49.762
Give everything to Him.

1035
01:51:49.762 --> 01:51:50.762
Give your family to Him.

1036
01:51:50.762 --> 01:51:51.762
Give your marriage to Him.

1037
01:51:51.762 --> 01:51:52.762
Give your pride to Him.

1038
01:51:52.762 --> 01:51:53.762
Give your uncleanness to Him.

1039
01:51:53.762 --> 01:51:54.762
Give your anger to Him.

1040
01:51:54.762 --> 01:51:56.762
Give it all to Him.

1041
01:51:56.762 --> 01:52:00.762
For He has endured it on the cross.

1042
01:52:00.762 --> 01:52:02.762
And He is your Savior.

1043
01:52:02.762 --> 01:52:05.762
He is the Savior for those who love Him.

1044
01:52:05.762 --> 01:52:07.762
In the name of Jesus.

1045
01:52:07.762 --> 01:52:09.762
Praise God. Amen.

1046
01:52:09.762 --> 01:52:10.762
Amen, amen.

